<div data-stock-sell-calculator>
  <section class="input-section z-section">
    <h2 class="z-section-title">输入持仓数据</h2>
    <div class="input-card z-panel">
      <div class="input-grid">
        <div class="input-group z-field">
          <label for="cost">每股买入成本 <span class="field-unit">元/股</span></label>
          <input type="number" id="cost" min="0.01" step="any" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="例如 10.00" aria-describedby="calculator-error" />
        </div>
        <div class="input-group z-field">
          <label for="shares">持有股数 <span class="field-unit">股</span></label>
          <input type="number" id="shares" min="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="例如 1000" aria-describedby="calculator-error" />
        </div>
        <div class="input-group z-field">
          <label for="dividend">每股分红 <span class="field-unit">元/股</span></label>
          <input type="number" id="dividend" min="0" step="any" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="例如 0.50" aria-describedby="calculator-error" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="input-insights">
        <div class="natural-yield-card">
          <span class="insight-label">当前成本对应的股息率</span>
          <strong id="natural-yield-value" class="insight-value">—</strong>
          <span class="insight-note">每股分红 ÷ 每股买入成本</span>
        </div>
        <div class="assumption-list" aria-label="策略假设">
          <span>每次卖出 100 股的整数倍，且至少保留 100 股</span>
          <span>只显示卖出价格高于买入成本的结果</span>
          <span>目标股息率按 4%–100%，每 1% 计算一次</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p id="calculator-error" class="calculator-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      <button id="calc-btn" class="z-btn-primary" type="button">计算卖出价格</button>
      <p id="calculator-status" class="calculator-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="table-section z-section" id="result-section" hidden>
    <h2 class="z-section-title" id="result-title" tabindex="-1">可获利卖点</h2>
    <p id="result-summary" class="result-summary"></p>
    <p class="scroll-hint">表格可左右滑动，查看全部数据。</p>
    <div class="table-wrapper z-table-wrapper" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="卖点结果表格，可左右滚动查看更多列">
      <table class="sell-table z-data-table" aria-describedby="result-summary">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="col-yield">目标股息率</th>
            <th class="col-lots">卖出股数</th>
            <th class="col-price">卖出价格（元/股）</th>
            <th class="col-cost">摊薄成本（元/股）</th>
            <th class="col-remain">剩余股数</th>
            <th class="col-profit">相对买入成本涨幅</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="result-body"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <details class="explain-section z-section">
    <summary>计算方法与注意事项</summary>
    <div class="explain-card z-panel">
      <p class="explain-intro">卖出部分持仓后，将卖出所得冲减原持仓总成本，再用剩余成本除以剩余股数，得到摊薄成本。下表列出使摊薄成本对应目标股息率的卖出价格。</p>
      <div class="formula-group">
        <span class="formula-label">目标摊薄成本</span>
        <span class="formula-eq">= 每股分红 ÷ 目标股息率</span>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-group">
        <span class="formula-label">卖出价格</span>
        <span class="formula-eq">= (持仓总成本 − 剩余股数 × 目标摊薄成本) ÷ 卖出股数</span>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-group">
        <span class="formula-label">相对买入成本涨幅</span>
        <span class="formula-eq">= (卖出价格 − 每股买入成本) ÷ 每股买入成本 × 100%</span>
      </div>
      <p class="explain-note">未计入交易费用、税费和未来分红变化；表中价格是数学目标，并非实际成交价格。若每股分红为 0，目标摊薄成本也为 0。</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>

<script>
  import '../../scripts/stock-sell-calculator'
</script>

